{"id":"18.09.Metrology","contentHtml":"<p>As a <strong>key Unity Developer</strong> on the \"Metrology\" project, I turned static 3D models into <strong>fully interactive, functional simulators</strong>, working in a team with 3D modelers and under the guidance of professors.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key task was to <strong>programmatically emulate</strong> the operation of complex, high-precision measuring instruments. Having received ready-made 3D assets, I had to <strong>write all the logic that would exactly recreate the methodology of working with them</strong> in an interactive environment.</p>\n<h2>Engineering Solution</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>\"Bringing to Life\" 3D Models:</strong> From scratch, I <strong>programmed all interaction logic</strong> with 3D models, including setting up moving parts, input handling, and exact recreation of mechanism operations (micrometer drum rotation, etc.).</li>\n<li><strong>Step-by-Step Learning System:</strong> Implemented a <strong>hint and action sequence control system</strong> that guided the student through the manual and checked the correctness of operations.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Flagship Product Created:</strong> Successfully implemented one of the company's key and most complex educational complexes.</li>\n<li><strong>Proven Expertise in Simulations:</strong> The project demonstrates the ability to <strong>create realistic, methodologically correct simulations</strong> of complex equipment.</li>\n<li><strong>Teamwork Experience:</strong> Gained valuable experience working in a <strong>full-fledged production pipeline</strong>: I took 3D assets from modelers, technical specifications from professors, and turned them into a finished software product.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Virtual Simulator \"Metrology\"","date":"2018-09","type":"project","tagsArray":["PC","Unity","C#"],"heroVideo":["e0JyvUt7uMs"],"shortDescription":"<p>As a Unity Developer in a team, <mark>“brought to life” static 3D models</mark>, transforming them into interactive simulators of complex measuring instruments.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://labstand.ru/catalog/metrologiya-tehnicheskie-izmereniya-v-mashinostroenii/virtualnaya-laboratoriya-metrologiya-standartizacziya-i-sertifikacziya-lp-mt"],"role":"team","projectIcon":"/images/projects/18.09.Metrology/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/18.09.Metrology/card.mp4?v=1765047025957","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/18.09.Metrology/screenshots/1.webp","width":1080,"height":612},{"src":"/images/projects/18.09.Metrology/screenshots/2.webp","width":1080,"height":612},{"src":"/images/projects/18.09.Metrology/screenshots/3.webp","width":1080,"height":612}]}